nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">淘宝MNN团队开源轻量化模型MNN-Pocket-0.3B，iPhone 18 Pro解码达350 token/s</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 服务，提供云端智能体运行框架</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash模型：单次生成时长增至15秒，成本降低30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4699646d66c40c3e0399ff091b60a196.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布AI视频生成模型Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash，在生成时长、场景一致性及API定价方面实现全面升级。该模型将单次视频生成的最大持续时长从10秒提升至15秒，减少了对多步拼接的依赖。在成本方面，720p视频生成费用由每秒0.10美元降至0.07美元，降幅达30%，单段15秒720p视频API成本降至1.05美元。功能上，新模型增强了多视角下人物、徽标及文字的保持力，支持多回合对话式编辑，用户可局部调整光线、背景或拍摄角度，并改进了唇形同步与多说话人交互能力。模型延续了360p草稿预览及最高4K输出支持。目前，Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash已通过Google AI Studio、Google Cloud、Google Flow及Google Vids面向开发者与创作者开放，旨在推</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">用 AI 做 PPT 被开除，公司反赔 4.6 万：法院判了</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c2ed4b47a20ee47c937ab5044d85ce5f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">用 AI 做 PPT 被开除，公司反赔 4.6 万：法院判了AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 6, 202637北京市朝阳区法院近日审结一起劳动争议，把&quot;用 AI 办公&quot;的边界摆上了台面。2024 年 7 月，某保险公司员工吴女士为提效，把自行整理的公司稽核问题数据表上传到第三方 AI 平台，借 AI 辅助做 PPT。耐人寻味的是，此前她的部门与直属领导曾多次推荐这类工具，认为能明显提升效率。可一个月后，公司却以&quot;严重违反信息安全规定&quot;为由将她解雇，吴女士随即把公司告上法庭。法院：没禁止，就别事后算账 公司主张，那张表属内部高度核心保密信息，上传行为有泄露商业秘密的风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">淘宝MNN团队开源轻量化模型MNN-Pocket-0.3B，iPhone 18 Pro解码达350 token/s</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dc8fb6ba207566fadc38f737e394cd79.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">淘宝MNN团队正式开源面向移动端的轻量化大语言模型MNN-Pocket-0.3B。该模型拥有约3亿参数，采用INT4量化，部署文件体积仅173MB。在iPhone 18 Pro真机测试中，其离线解码速度达350 token/s；在iPad Pro M5上，Decode吞吐量达466 token/s，约为Qwen3-0.6B的1.63倍，且峰值内存增量仅228MB。团队通过将词表从151K精简至64K，显著降低了参数开销。功耗方面，在一加13（骁龙8至尊版）测试中，执行100次任务仅消耗约0.3%电量。在IFEval等11项综合评测中，该模型表现超越MiniCPM4-0.5B及Qwen3-0.6B等同类模型。此次开源涵盖Base、SFT、MNN部署版及DFlash2投机解码草稿模型等多个版本，旨在为开发者提供高性</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 服务，提供云端智能体运行框架</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面（Moonshot AI）于11月5日正式推出 Kimi Hosted Agents（托管智能体）服务，旨在为企业和开发者提供开箱即用的云端智能体运行框架。该服务将支撑 Agent 高效运行的底层 Harness 直接云端化，彻底省去了用户自行搭建与维护复杂运行环境的繁琐流程。Kimi Hosted Agents 支持7×24小时全天候托管，能够轻松应对长时间跨度的复杂任务执行，并为多智能体（Multi-Agent）之间的高效协同提供稳定底座。通过此项服务，月之暗面大幅降低了企业落地高级 AI 应用的技术门槛与运维成本，使开发者无需关注底层架构即可专注于智能体逻辑的构建与优化，有效提升了复杂 AI 业务的开发效率与运行稳定性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月6日，Meta 宣布个人 AI 助手 Muse 正式上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能，面向美国用户开放，覆盖移动端、网页及 Mac 应用。该功能由 Muse Realtime Voice 与 Muse Realtime Avatar 模型驱动，前者负责内容与语调生成，后者同步生成表情、口型与动作。系统支持流式输出 448×768 分辨率、25fps 的竖屏视频，端到端响应延迟约 870 毫秒。用户可实现实时语音打断，并支持数百种声音风格及多种虚拟形象切换。Meta 将其定位为更自然的个人智能体，旨在满足用户在双手忙碌时的交互需求，如任务安排、头脑风暴及面试练习等。此外，虚拟形象支持一键分享至 Instagram、Facebook 和 WhatsApp。此次更新标志着 Muse 从纯文本交互转向具备实时音画同</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
